OPTION G — Hover-expand strip
==============================

IDLE (mouse away):
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                         │
│  (tree content)                                         │
│                                                         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  ██░ ██░    ●3   +   ⚙                                  │  ← skinny strip
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

HOVERED (mouse over footer):
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  (tree content)                                         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  [Boost] [██░ Claude] [██░ Codex]                       │
│  [+task] [zen] [explode] [📁]                           │
│  [agent●3] [panel] [⊟] [⬇]                              │
│  [···] [≡] [⚙]                                          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

· Default: dot-only summary (≤ 6 glyphs, no labels)
· Hover/focus: full expanded panel (animated height)
· Tree gets max vertical room when not engaged
· Settings = last (in expanded view)
· Pros:  super clean idle state, "hidden until needed"
· Cons:  hover-only = bad for touch / keyboard,
         layout shift on expand can feel jumpy,
         users must learn the gesture
